@ yoshi_tuning: Yoshi's numbers, as data patches (no code). Each value is
@ loaded by the game at run time and used only by Yoshi's code (ledger F0086,
@ F0088). Bytes are little-endian. Delete a block to keep the vanilla value.
@
@   value              vanilla           here
@   fruits per egg     5   (05000000)    3   (03000000)
@   flutter length     30 frames         60 frames (3C000000)
@   flutter lift fast  0.2  (CDCC4C3E)   unchanged; 0.3 = 9A99993E
@   flutter lift slow  0.07 (295C8F3D)   unchanged; 0.1 = CDCCCC3D

Yoshi_fruitsPerEgg:
    type:    data
    address: 0x00B0C0C8
    data:    03 00 00 00

Yoshi_flutterFrames:
    type:    data
    address: 0x00B0C0CC
    data:    3C 00 00 00

@ Yoshi_flutterLiftFast:
@     type:    data
@     address: 0x007D3F94
@     data:    9A 99 99 3E
@
@ Yoshi_flutterLiftSlow:
@     type:    data
@     address: 0x007D3F98
@     data:    CD CC CC 3D
